---
// ComparisonTable.astro
---

<section id="comparison" class="w-full py-10 sm:py-16 bg-white border-y border-[#ebebeb] overflow-hidden">
  <div class="w-full max-w-6xl mx-auto px-3.5 sm:px-6">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mb-10">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 font-mono text-xs font-semibold uppercase text-[#8f8f8f] tracking-wider mb-2">
        <span>LEGAL COMPARISON MATRIX</span>
      </div>
      <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-[#171717]">
        Covered vs. Not Covered under the Gratuity Act 1972
      </h2>
      <p class="text-sm text-[#4d4d4d] mt-2 leading-relaxed">
        Understand the crucial legal distinctions between organizations governed by the Payment of Gratuity Act and those that fall outside its statutory purview.
      </p>
    </div>

      <!-- Mobile Scroll Indicator -->
      <div class="sm:hidden text-[10px] text-[#8f8f8f] font-mono mb-2 flex items-center gap-1">
        <span>↔ Swipe horizontally to compare columns</span>
      </div>

      <!-- Responsive Table -->
      <div class="w-full max-w-full overflow-x-auto border border-[#ebebeb] rounded-xl shadow-2xs bg-white">
        <table class="w-full text-left text-xs sm:text-sm min-w-[560px]">
        <thead>
          <tr class="bg-[#fafafa] border-b border-[#ebebeb] font-mono text-xs text-[#171717]">
            <th class="py-4 px-4 sm:px-6 font-semibold w-1/4">Parameter</th>
            <th class="py-4 px-4 sm:px-6 font-semibold w-3/8 text-blue-700 bg-blue-50/40 border-x border-[#ebebeb]">
              Covered Under Act 1972
            </th>
            <th class="py-4 px-4 sm:px-6 font-semibold w-3/8">
              Not Covered Under Act
            </th>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody class="divide-y divide-[#ebebeb] text-[#4d4d4d]">
          <tr>
            <td class="py-4 px-4 sm:px-6 font-medium text-[#171717]">Applicability</td>
            <td class="py-4 px-4 sm:px-6 bg-blue-50/20 border-x border-[#ebebeb]">
              Establishments, factories, mines, ports, oilfields, and shops employing <strong>10 or more persons</strong> on any day in the preceding 12 months.
            </td>
            <td class="py-4 px-4 sm:px-6">
              Organizations with fewer than 10 employees, or organizations where gratuity is paid as a voluntary employer benefit or service contract.
            </td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td class="py-4 px-4 sm:px-6 font-medium text-[#171717]">Calculation Formula</td>
            <td class="py-4 px-4 sm:px-6 bg-blue-50/20 border-x border-[#ebebeb] font-mono text-xs">
              <span class="font-bold text-[#171717]">(15 × Last Drawn Salary × Years) ÷ 26</span>
              <span class="block text-[11px] text-[#8f8f8f] mt-1 font-sans">Divided by 26 working days (excluding 4 Sundays).</span>
            </td>
            <td class="py-4 px-4 sm:px-6 font-mono text-xs">
              <span class="font-bold text-[#171717]">(15 × 10-mo Avg Salary × Completed Years) ÷ 30</span>
              <span class="block text-[11px] text-[#8f8f8f] mt-1 font-sans">Effectively half a month’s average salary (Salary × 0.5 × Years).</span>
            </td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td class="py-4 px-4 sm:px-6 font-medium text-[#171717]">Tenure Rounding Rule</td>
            <td class="py-4 px-4 sm:px-6 bg-blue-50/20 border-x border-[#ebebeb]">
              <strong class="text-emerald-700">Favorable Rounding:</strong> Any fraction exceeding 6 months counts as 1 full year. (e.g., 6 years 7 months = <strong>7 years</strong>).
            </td>
            <td class="py-4 px-4 sm:px-6">
              <strong class="text-rose-700">Strict Completed Years:</strong> Fractional months are disregarded entirely. (e.g., 6 years 11 months = <strong>6 years</strong>).
            </td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td class="py-4 px-4 sm:px-6 font-medium text-[#171717]">Salary Base Definition</td>
            <td class="py-4 px-4 sm:px-6 bg-blue-50/20 border-x border-[#ebebeb]">
              <strong>Last Drawn Basic Pay + Dearness Allowance (DA)</strong> in the final month of employment.
            </td>
            <td class="py-4 px-4 sm:px-6">
              <strong>Average Basic Pay + DA</strong> drawn during the last 10 calendar months preceding termination.
            </td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td class="py-4 px-4 sm:px-6 font-medium text-[#171717]">Maximum Statutory Limit</td>
            <td class="py-4 px-4 sm:px-6 bg-blue-50/20 border-x border-[#ebebeb]">
              ₹20,00,000 (₹20 Lakhs) under the Payment of Gratuity (Amendment) Act.
            </td>
            <td class="py-4 px-4 sm:px-6">
              ₹20,00,000 (₹20 Lakhs) cumulative lifetime tax exemption limit under Section 10(10)(iii).
            </td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td class="py-4 px-4 sm:px-6 font-medium text-[#171717]">Delay Interest Penalty</td>
            <td class="py-4 px-4 sm:px-6 bg-blue-50/20 border-x border-[#ebebeb]">
              Mandatory simple interest (presently 10% per annum) under Section 7(3A) if not disbursed within 30 days of leaving.
            </td>
            <td class="py-4 px-4 sm:px-6">
              Governed strictly by company policy, employment agreement, or civil labor court decree.
            </td>
          </tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
